{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>對於需要高度集中注意力的學生、程式開發者或創作者而言，一款兼具美學與實用的番茄鐘工具能顯著提升工作流暢度。Lumina Chronos 將傳統番茄鐘轉化為視覺享受，透過平滑的色彩過渡與動態效果引導使用者進入心流狀態，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>下載。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-223.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>沉浸式視覺化專注體驗</h2>\n<p>這款應用以玻璃擬態設計呈現寧靜的工作空間，發光圓環隨時間流逝由綠變黃再轉紅，清晰提示剩餘時間。內建自動循環功能管理工休節奏，並在休息期間展示名人格言助您 recharge 思維。支援 iPhone 及 iPad 橫豎屏操作，可自定義時間長度與回饋音效，且無需註冊帳戶即可離線使用，界面極簡無干擾。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-37-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-38-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-39-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-40-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Lumina Chronos</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/lumina-chronos/id6779196533?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T19:44:38.437117+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T19:28:21+00:00","fetched_